# TRUSTTECH — COMPLETE MARKETPLACE DEVELOPMENT PROMPT

## PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, professional, production-oriented technology marketplace called **TrustTech**.

TrustTech connects businesses, startups, individuals, and organizations with qualified technology professionals who can deliver websites, software, design, and other digital services.

The platform should combine the best practical features of professional freelancing marketplaces with a simpler, more trustworthy experience.

This is an existing project being renamed and expanded. Do not treat it as an entirely unrelated project.

Your responsibility is to inspect the existing codebase, understand its current functionality, preserve working features, and improve it into a complete application.

Do not merely generate a landing page or static demonstration.

The goal is to build a functional marketplace with authentication, dashboards, developer verification, project management, applications, payments architecture, and administrative controls.

