# 10. DEVELOPER REGISTRATION AND VERIFICATION

This is a critical existing feature.

Preserve the current developer verification page and improve it where necessary.

Required fields:

- Professional title.
- Experience level.
- Professional biography.
- Skills.
- Portfolio URL.
- GitHub URL.
- Additional project links.
- Project description.
- Accuracy agreement.

